  "evidence": "AP3 root independently compared the whole original TIFF overview, all six native card-field montages and all fifteen overlapping original/current-preview pairs, including every source bank, route, margin, hanging reference hook, header and footer, then actually viewed the current whole JuliaMono preview. 35 native blocks, 66 printed inputs, 30 output ports, 52 nets and 29 diamonds were reviewed. Direct same-TIFF crops verify AF2B D09, AW4H worn A (closed left cap survives), AX4J H, AD1H U03AI with its closed A arch matching AC1G; no inferred change to H. Blank receiving wedges at 2H, 3C, 5B and 5E remain unnamed; source 6K UR/DUT, empty output wedge and 6M 4633G1 are literal and take precedence over A1. Tight native controls verify the three inline 2 annotations at 4J/K/L and inline 6 at 5K are not physical pin IDs. Source PADDA rail has a real gap before ST; P3 control rail fans to all three numbered controls with separate scan rail, while 5K input5 remains isolated beyond its attached L cap and one white cell. Bottom 2N output and 7L feedback cross without joining. Local calibration accounts for scan warp at bank4; approved default bank columns are retained. All twelve right output rows/reference positions and all eight footer connector lines, title, DATE, MACH, LOG, FRAME, P.N., BLK BA and 08-08-69 713380 revision were checked against native source. No material discrepancy found; source-bound quartet and all actually viewed evidence are frozen only after exact 245x103 approved-glyph and pixel-identical TXT/JuliaMono verification.",
